}", "explanation": "The chunk-size header was parsed with strtol on a non-NUL-terminated buffer, allowing out-of-bounds reads. The fix NUL-terminates the header within the buffer bounds and validates the strtol result (endptr, errno, range) before assigning to chunk_size."}

